We hereby inform you that the Board of Directors of the Company, in their Board Meeting held on October 29, 2026, at the Registered Office of the Company which was commenced at 04:00 P.M. and concluded at 04:40 P.M., have, apart from other businesses;  
1. Considered, approved and taken on record the Unaudited Standalone Financial Results of the Company for the half year ended on September 30, 2026 along with Limited Review Reports.  
In this regard, we attached herewith the following; 
o Unaudited Standalone Financial Results for the half year ended on September 30, 2026
o Limited Review Reports

2. Adopted statement of deviation or variation issued by statutory auditor for utilization of issue proceeds raised by Initial Public Offer in accordance with Regulation 32 of SEBI (LODR) 2015.
